Xixieqi Dockyard~
   Burly men push past you, carrying barrels and crates about the dock area as
they load and unload cargo from all manner of merchant vessels. The scent of
seafood is almost overwhelming, making you wonder how anyone can bear to work
in a place such as this. To the north, the city docks meet the open ocean
while to the west, tall ships await their chance to offload their goods.
